    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wondered what it's like to be a CCTV operator watching paranormal footage where you can die at any given moment? A life threatening job, for sure. But an exciting one nonetheless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your predecessor ended badly, but <u>will you</u>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Become a new Anomaly Observer today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/d5d104c81f31ac6a23c6c86cc7b939ba.poster.avif?t=1755612007\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/d5d104c81f31ac6a23c6c86cc7b939ba.webm?t=1755612007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/d5d104c81f31ac6a23c6c86cc7b939ba.mp4?t=1755612007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore all cameras in the area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find changes happening while on shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive until 6 AM</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/30f8886aecc656c4b31713975d9850f7.poster.avif?t=1755612007\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/30f8886aecc656c4b31713975d9850f7.webm?t=1755612007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/30f8886aecc656c4b31713975d9850f7.mp4?t=1755612007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different areas where paranormal things are happening! <u>Each new area is more difficult, than the previous one.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience weirdest phenomena and anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other Anomaly Observers in Leaderboards and become the best one!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various gamemodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies are more and more intensive as the contract goes on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No contract is the same - <u><strong>there are hundreds of different anomalies that can happen at any given time!</strong></u></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wondered what it's like to be a CCTV operator watching paranormal footage where you can die at any given moment? A life threatening job, for sure. But an exciting one nonetheless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your predecessor ended badly, but <u>will you</u>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Become a new Anomaly Observer today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/d5d104c81f31ac6a23c6c86cc7b939ba.poster.avif?t=1755612007\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/d5d104c81f31ac6a23c6c86cc7b939ba.webm?t=1755612007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/d5d104c81f31ac6a23c6c86cc7b939ba.mp4?t=1755612007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore all cameras in the area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find changes happening while on shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive until 6 AM</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/30f8886aecc656c4b31713975d9850f7.poster.avif?t=1755612007\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/30f8886aecc656c4b31713975d9850f7.webm?t=1755612007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/30f8886aecc656c4b31713975d9850f7.mp4?t=1755612007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different areas where paranormal things are happening! <u>Each new area is more difficult, than the previous one.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience weirdest phenomena and anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other Anomaly Observers in Leaderboards and become the best one!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various gamemodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies are more and more intensive as the contract goes on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No contract is the same - <u><strong>there are hundreds of different anomalies that can happen at any given time!</strong></u></p></li></ul>",
